BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Running Plan 2026//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Running Plan 2026 - 5K Focus
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Zagreb

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260922-recovery-5k@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260921T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260922T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260922T184500
SUMMARY:Run - HM Recovery
DESCRIPTION:4-5 km very easy @ 6:20-6:40/km. Only run if legs feel reasonably recovered from the HM. If sore or heavy, rest instead.
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260924-800-5k@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260921T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260924T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260924T190000
SUMMARY:Run - 4x800m 5K Sharpening
DESCRIPTION:If recovered: 2 km warm-up + 4x800m @ 4:20-4:25/km with 2 min easy jog recovery + 1-1.5 km cool-down. If still fatigued from the HM, replace with 30-40 min easy + 4 strides.
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260926-specific-5k@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260921T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260926T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260926T100000
SUMMARY:Run - 5K Specific
DESCRIPTION:If Thursday went well and legs are recovered: 2 km easy + 4 km @ 4:40-4:50/km comfortably hard + 2 km easy. Total ~8 km. If fatigued, keep the entire run easy.
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:run-20260929-easy-strides@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260921T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260929T180000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20260929T184500
SUMMARY:Run - Easy + Strides
DESCRIPTION:5 km easy @ ~6:00/km + 4x20 sec strides. Keep it relaxed and finish feeling fresh.
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:race-20261001-5k@running-plan
DTSTAMP:20260921T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20261001T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zagreb:20261001T193000
SUMMARY:5K Race
DESCRIPTION:Target ~4:30/km (~22:30). Km 1: 4:30-4:35. Km 2-3: around 4:30/km. Km 4: assess. Km 5: push hard. Do not start faster than target pace.
END:VEVENT

END:VCALENDAR
